ing in a nomad manner and wandering through Loftanima. The specimen acquired the abilities of: Controlling the plants in its body, being able to also alter it at will; Transferring its conscience\ and soul to new bodies through spore flowers that it can organically produce in its body given proper time, and if ingested by the target body; An evolved form of its original ability, now being able to copy the memories of its target. After some time wa\ndering, the specimen was found be Parvez Midam, a serial killer who tried to kill it, but ended up being killed instead, and, having its conscience transferred to the body of the criminal, now roams the country with his form, his MO and his twisted moral\s.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Arial 10 Tf)/DS(font: Arial,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920164134-03'00')/NM(d7acb930cdb148c288da8a71ac95f1c3)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Arial;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="text-align:justify">This entity originated of an incident involving the parasite entity of Radiant Resting, room 409. After spreading to a neighboring dimension, the parasite settled in an\ area that housed an entity with the shape of a fly that could absorb memories, later unwillingly bringing it to the hotel room. When trying to absorb the memories of one of its plants, it ended up being absorbed instead, leading to a battle of organisms \and almost rending and destroying the section connected to the parasite and consequently removing its ability to spread. After winning, the fly&#8217;s body was rebuilt with the shape of a plant-dog \(based on one of the parasite&#8217;s victims. The plan\ts had a grayish color, tying around the dog&#8217;s body like tapes, and its left eye was replaced with a gray flower\), and promptly escaped the place, further living in a nomad manner and wandering through Loftanima. The specimen acquired the abilities\ of: Controlling the plants in its body, being able to also alter it at will; Transferring its conscience and soul to new bodies through spore flowers that it can organically produce in its body given proper time, and if ingested by the target body; An ev\olved form of its original ability, now being able to copy the memories of its target. After some time wandering, the specimen was found be Parvez Midam, a serial killer who tried to kill it, but ended up being killed instead, and, having its conscience t\ransferred to the body of the criminal, now roams the country with his form, his MO and his twisted morals.</span></p></body>)/Rect[45.3301 52.864 571.302 206.874]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj133 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(   Dif)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg 0 Tc 0 Tw 100 Tz 0 TL 0 Ts 0 Tr /Helv 21.8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 21.8pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240915175540-03'00')/NM(1136aaeffc294a48afa27816b1ee9af3)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:21.8pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">   Dif</span></p></body>)/Rect[17.301 674.202 180.873 699.612]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj134 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(   Dif)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg 0 Tc 0 Tw 100 Tz 0 TL 0 Ts 0 Tr /Helv 21.8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 21.8pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240915175546-03'00')/NM(1219d7225def45e683de28447d5ac6ff)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="ht