e, use them as a grappling hook for off-ground movement, planting itself on the ground to move below it or even use them a\s a slingshot to cover huge distances.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 9 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 9.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920165528-03'00')/NM(844ec8dc96c74e098e212ff672c9ebf7)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Vine-based Movement - Uses the plants that wrap around its body to move and evade attacks, being able to modify its shapes if possible, use them as a g\rappling hook for off-ground movement, planting itself on the ground to move below it or even use them as a slingshot to cover huge distances.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 563.985 520.366 621.995]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj151 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Plant Strikes - The same plants that can be used as movement can also be used to attack, with a common bash, piercing the target on a specific point, grabbing the target with the vines \(in similar ways to the parasite of room 409 or even create and launc\h seeds which explode on impact \(area damage\).)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920165657-03'00')/NM(c91dd0727aea4492802a48e2eeb56f21)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Plant Strikes - The same plants that can be used as movement can also be used to attack, with a common bash, piercing the target on a specific point, \grabbing the target with the vines \(in similar ways to the parasite of room 409 or even create and launch seeds which explode on impact \(area damage\).</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 476.825 518.402 534.835]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj152 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Savage Tactics -  Uses the learned tactics from its experience in different types of living beings to protect its lift. The ones related to plants include stun seeds and generation seeds to try to steal organic matter for itself or even create new candida\tes for new bodies. Cornering the target like a predator corners prey, and scattering to acquire a vantage point on the area where the battle occurs.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920165939-03'00')/NM(0b13cda8c8ee498badf7f34d2c2a2f89)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Savage Tactics -  Uses the learned tactics from its experience in different types of living beings to protect its lift. The ones related to plants incl\ude stun seeds and generation seeds to try to steal organic matter for itself or even create new candidates for new bodies. Cornering the target like a predator corners prey, and scattering to acquire a vantage point on the area where the battle occurs.</\span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 387.171 515.13 445.181]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj153 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Previous Bodies' Memories - The acquired knowledge from previous versions of its life. Can store the memories of up to 4 different bodies, discarding the oldest one \(*the fly one being the only exception\) if more than 4 are absorbed.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920170109-03'00')/NM(2383cc0cbc544ff083fa42e90841cde2)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Previous Bodies' Memories - The acquired knowledge from previous versions of its life. Can store the memories of up to 4 different bodies, discarding \the oldest one \(*the fly one being the only exception\) if more than 4 are absorbed.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 308.126 518.402 354.136]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj154 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Lure - The characteristics of Midam gave the creature the ability to communicate and rationalize as a psychopath, making use of luring tactics and convincing to acquire new victims.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920170422-03'00')/NM(b7fd72cf7709488ca17aad559ac010e3)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Lure - The characteristics of Midam gave the creature the ability to communicate and rationalize as a psychopath, making use of luring tactics and con\vincing to acquire new victims.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 206.738 515.784 264.748]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj155 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Plant Body - Uses its plant based body to resist attacks, in case evading is ineffective, absorb them if they involve energy or similar stuff, Photosynthesize to regenerate CS or steal it through the Vitality Steal ability.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920170555-03'00')/NM(4ad9b17ed327424288eb2d55c9c580e4)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Plant Body - Uses its plant based body to resist attacks, in case evading is ineffective, absorb them if they involve energy or similar stuff, Photosy\nthesize to regenerate CS or steal it through the Vitality Steal ability.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 115.427 511.202 173.437]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj156 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Bloodlust - By connecting with the mind of Midam, the fly also absorbed his taste for Slasher movies, incorporating some of his techniques into its hunting methods, be it for movements or attacks, dropping all civility to just try and eviscerate the targe\t at all costs or trying to take advantage and parasite the target temporarily. \(Equivalent time to 3 Turns\).)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920170321-03'00')/NM(e5d6d6beb785412c93a0ea2c110921d7)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.o